    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "Mathematics has always been a source of deep fascination for me, especially since my early years. As a former student with an upper secondary education, I found it both challenging and rewarding. I use it daily in cooking, budgeting, and even in painting, where proportions matter. I don’t see it as rigid—it’s a language of patterns and logic that helps me understand the world.",
