    "Did you ever use AI to support your math learning in the last year? If yes, how was your experience?": "Yes, I used a simple AI app last year to review algebra and calculus concepts. It gave me step-by-step explanations and practice problems. It helped me clarify ideas I’d forgotten, especially around derivatives and quadratic equations. The interface was intuitive, and I appreciated how it didn’t overwhelm me with jargon. It felt like a helpful tutor, not a replacement.",
